msgid "habit day part"
msgstr "习惯统计的日间部分"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitDayPart|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The DayPart used by the figure’s explicitly bound holder within its temporal frame. The value supplies no universal hour boundaries."
msgstr "统计中显式绑定的持有者在其时间框架内使用的 DayPart。该值不提供通用小时边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitDayPart|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
