msgid "habit counted act"
msgstr "习惯统计计入的行为"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitMember|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An actual Activity occurrence retained as evidence for this figure. Membership does not identify a preferred activity or define how occasions were grouped into counts."
msgstr "作为此统计证据保留的实际 Activity 发生。成员关系不标识偏好，也不定义各场合如何分组成计数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitMember|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
