msgid "day-part reckoning holder"
msgstr "日间划分的持有者"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitHolder|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The Agent whose reckoning supplies this figure’s day-part boundaries, distinct from the refiner’s vantage and without privileging a universal schedule."
msgstr "其时间划分决定此统计日间部分边界的 Agent，区别于细化器视角，且不赋予任何通用作息优先地位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitHolder|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitHolder|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitHolder|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitHolder|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
