msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading gmeow:habitHolder ex:value ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitTemporalFrame|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "habit temporal frame"
msgstr "习惯统计的时间框架"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitTemporalFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual TemporalFrame in which the holder’s day-part reckoning is interpreted for this figure. It inherits the reference-frame spine without assigning fixed hours to a DayPart."
msgstr "解释此统计中持有者日间划分的实际 TemporalFrame。它继承参考框架主干，不向 DayPart 分配固定小时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitTemporalFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitTemporalFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitTemporalFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitTemporalFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:reading gmeow:habitTemporalFrame ex:value ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading gmeow:habitTemporalFrame ex:value ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/openItemAt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "source opening time"
msgstr "来源开启时间"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/openItemAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original holder-supplied date-time of the record that opened this item. It is not the refiner’s observation clock and supplies no invented timezone or precision."
msgstr "持有者为开启此事项的记录提供的原始日期时间。它不是细化器的观察时钟，不编造时区或精度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/openItemAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/openItemAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/openItemAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/openItemAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:reading gmeow:openItemAt \"2026-10-01T09:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading gmeow:openItemAt \"2026-10-01T09:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceReading|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Recurrence Reading"
msgstr "再现解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A versioned process’s reading of repeated appearances of one related resource within offered records and an optional supplied settling boundary. It asserts no motive, preference or global absence of settlement."
msgstr "版本化过程对某关联资源在所提供记录中反复出现的解读，可带有所提供的解决边界。不声明动机、偏好或全局没有解决。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecurrenceReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:reading a gmeow:RecurrenceReading ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading a gmeow:RecurrenceReading ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HabitFigure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Habit Figure"
msgstr "按日间部分的活动统计"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HabitFigure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A versioned process’s reported activity counts over offered acts, under a named holder’s day-part reckoning and temporal frame. The figure is neither a preference judgment nor a diagnosis of habit."
msgstr "版本化过程对所提供行为报告的活动计数，依据具名持有者的日间划分及时间框架。此统计既非偏好判断，也非习惯诊断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HabitFigure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HabitFigure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HabitFigure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HabitFigure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:reading a gmeow:HabitFigure ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading a gmeow:HabitFigure ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitChosenCount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chosen count"
msgstr "报告的选择次数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitChosenCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-reported nonnegative count of choices for the selected activity in this figure’s scope. Its denominator and grouping belong to the consumer’s declared reporting method, not to an implicit inequality."
msgstr "来源报告的此统计范围内选择指定活动的非负次数。分母及分组属于消费者声明的报告方法，不受隐含不等式支配。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitChosenCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitChosenCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitChosenCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitChosenCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:reading gmeow:habitChosenCount \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading gmeow:habitChosenCount \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitSituationCount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported situation count"
msgstr "报告的情境次数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitSituationCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-reported nonnegative count of situations considered for this figure. It does not define a denominator relationship to habitChosenCount or imply which situations were eligible."
msgstr "来源报告的此统计所考虑情境的非负次数。不定义其与 habitChosenCount 的分母关系，也不暗示哪些情境符合条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitSituationCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly scoped process reading with retained source evidence."
msgstr "用于具有明确范围并保留来源证据的过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitSituationCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring global absence, preference, diagnosis or source-subject endorsement from a process reading."
msgstr "避免从过程解读推断全局缺失、偏好、诊断或来源主体认可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitSituationCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the source, readingScope and versioned vantage; report supplied values without defaults and preserve earlier readings."
msgstr "保留来源、readingScope 及版本化视角；报告所提供的值而不使用默认值，并保留先前解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/habitSituationCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this attributed record: ex:reading gmeow:habitSituationCount \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "保留此有归属记录：ex:reading gmeow:habitSituationCount \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SettledItemEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "settled item evidence constraint"
msgstr "已解决事项证据约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SettledItemEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reading explicitly marked openItemSettled retains at least one original settling record. The law certifies supplied evidence presence, not real-world resolution."
msgstr "显式标记为 openItemSettled 的解读须保留至少一条原始解决记录。此法则检查所提供证据的存在，不认证现实解决。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SettledItemEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic state or evidence consistency within an attributed reading."
msgstr "用于检查有归属解读内的内在状态或证据一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SettledItemEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating this law as proof of global absence, successful settlement or statistical correctness."
msgstr "避免将此法则视为全局缺失、成功解决或统计正确性的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SettledItemEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the realized formula with the source scope and retain original evidence when reporting a violation."
msgstr "结合来源范围读取已实现公式，并在报告违例时保留原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SettledItemEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:SettledItemEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:OpenItemReading ."
msgstr "保留此法则：gmeow:SettledItemEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:OpenItemReading ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "unsettled item evidence constraint"
msgstr "未解决事项证据约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Readings explicitly marked open, replied or let go contain no settledBy record. Other declared state values remain open to their own semantics."
msgstr "显式标记为开放、已回复或已放下的解读不得含有 settledBy 记录。其他声明的状态值仍可拥有自己的语义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic state or evidence consistency within an attributed reading."
msgstr "用于检查有归属解读内的内在状态或证据一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating this law as proof of global absence, successful settlement or statistical correctness."
msgstr "避免将此法则视为全局缺失、成功解决或统计正确性的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the realized formula with the source scope and retain original evidence when reporting a violation."
msgstr "结合来源范围读取已实现公式，并在报告违例时保留原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:OpenItemReading ."
msgstr "保留此法则：gmeow:UnsettledItemEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:OpenItemReading ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "state reading source scope constraint"
msgstr "状态解读来源范围约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every source observed by an open-item, recurrence or habit reading belongs to that reading’s declared offered-record scope."
msgstr "待办事项、再现或习惯统计解读所观察的每个来源须属于该解读声明的所提供记录范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic state or evidence consistency within an attributed reading."
msgstr "用于检查有归属解读内的内在状态或证据一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating this law as proof of global absence, successful settlement or statistical correctness."
msgstr "避免将此法则视为全局缺失、成功解决或统计正确性的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the realized formula with the source scope and retain original evidence when reporting a violation."
msgstr "结合来源范围读取已实现公式，并在报告违例时保留原始证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:readingScope ."
msgstr "保留此法则：gmeow:StateReadingSourceScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:readingScope ."

