msgid "Every act retained as habit-figure evidence belongs to the offered-record scope. Membership alone imposes no count equality or denominator inequality."
msgstr "每个作为习惯统计证据保留的行为须属于所提供记录范围。仅有成员关系不强加计数相等或分母不等式。"

